	(text "Servo rail: external 6 V in, two servo headers. Isolated from every other rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 205.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0aa0a946-6b6e-4d35-a062-aac5ccc7c7b5")
	)
	(text "Aux output: low-side switch at battery voltage, 1 A at most"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23.495 111.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "111ff7e6-26f9-45e4-9a2f-505a5b1128ca")
	)
	(text "I_trip = 64 kV / 32.4k = 1.98 A (R14).\nIN1 and IN2 both low for 1 ms: sleep, outputs Hi-Z. R15/R16 hold them low at reset,\nand R16 keeps the strapping pin IO12 low at boot (SPEC.md section 3).\nC23/C24 are 1 nF, not 10 nF: a tenth of the switching loss (REVIEW C-03)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 277.368 100.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2b21db78-282a-422d-967a-d2a614f64ebb")
	)
	(text "Kickstand actuator: DRV8871 full bridge, 2 A limit"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 214.63 26.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "73ecb6c1-342f-40bd-bf1c-137d3fc9f368")
	)
	(text "U8 turns the ESP32's 3.3 V into a 5 V gate drive: the IRLML0100's on-resistance is specified\nat 4.5 V (235 mOhm max). R19 holds the FET off while the 5 V rail is down, R17 while the ESP32\nis in reset. D9 freewheels an inductive load into VBAT. Fuse the harness: 2 A inline (REVIEW C-11)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23.622 195.834 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "926416a2-9e7c-4634-b4ea-98c0420ae191")
	)
	(text "Trip = Vz + Vbe x (1 + R13/R12) = 43 + 0.6 x 5.7 = about 46.4 V\n(43.7 to 48.5 V over the zener's 2 %, its knee and 0 to 70 C; above 43 V at -20 C)\nDRV8871 absolute maximum 50 V, full pack 42.2 V. Below the trip, Q2 is fully on: R11 pulls\nits gate down and D7 holds it 12 V below the source."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23.876 100.838 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e5339342-83c5-46fd-bd21-d4109eabaa1c")
	)
	(text "Over-voltage cut-off: VBAT to VM_ACT  (D-03)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.13 26.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f03c4d48-9e60-4c36-bb3d-351b99dfbe4b")
	)
	(text "+6V comes from an external LM2596HV module on J3, set to 6.0 V before it is plugged in.\nQ4 blocks a reversed input (R20 pulls its gate to GND). No other rail touches +6V.\nR21/R22 limit the current into a servo's signal pin. SERVO1_C and SERVO2_C go on\nto the ESD array U13 on the IO sheet."
